.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1556","id":1213201772,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85IT_1s","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-08-12T14:52:28Z","updated_at":"2022-08-12T14:52:28Z","body":"Also +1 to add and +1 on the feelings expressed above re: license names / IDs.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1213201772/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1221938475","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1556#issuecomment-1221938475","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1556","id":1221938475,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85I1U0r","user":{"login":"OliverFendt","id":15192452,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTkyNDUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15192452?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverFendt","html_url":"https://github.com/OliverFendt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverFendt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverFendt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverFendt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverFendt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverFendt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverFendt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverFendt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverFendt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverFendt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-08-22T07:06:35Z","updated_at":"2022-08-22T07:09:45Z","body":"I had a look at the new license request and have several comments.\r\nGiven the text:\r\n\r\n> Copyright (C) 1994, 1995, 1996, 1997, 1998, 1999, 2000, 2001, 2002, # 2003, 2004, 2005, 2006, 2007, 2008, 2009 Free Software Foundation, # Inc. # This Makefile.in is free software; the Free Software Foundation # gives unlimited permission to copy and/or distribute it, # with or without modifications, as long as this notice is preserved.\r\n\r\n> This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, # but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY, to the extent permitted by law; without # even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A # PARTICULAR PURPOSE.\r\n\r\n1. All comment signs # shall be removed before inculsion\r\n2. The Copyright statement shall be removed, since it belongs not to the the license text\r\n3. The \"Makefile.in\" shall be marked as \"not to be used for matching\" since there are plenty of variations on this word out there like: > This file is free software;...\r\n\r\nPerhaps the name FSFULLWWD is a bit nicer than FSFULLRWD?\r\n\r\nBesides the comments I agree to include the text in the license list","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1221938475/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1224368419","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1556#issuecomment-1224368419","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1556","id":1224368419,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85I-mEj","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-08-23T17:10:21Z","updated_at":"2022-08-23T17:10:21Z","body":"@OliverFendt - thanks for the +1 and the markup mentioned in #3 is a good idea.\r\n\r\nAs to the comment signs and the copyright statement - this is covered in the matching guidelines and we don't generally alter things, especially removing the copyright notice, as you have suggested elsewhere. This would be a policy change that I don't think we should simply start doing ad hoc or for a particular license, but is something we should consider in and of itself.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1224368419/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1224371926","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1556#issuecomment-1224371926","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1556","id":1224371926,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85I-m7W","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-08-23T17:11:33Z","updated_at":"2022-08-23T17:11:33Z","body":"@richardfontana - do you want to prep the files to add this? we have some instructions here: https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/main/DOCS/new-license-workflow.md#accepted  :)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1224371926/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1224549661","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1556#issuecomment-1224549661","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1556","id":1224549661,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85I_SUd","user":{"login":"OliverFendt","id":15192452,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTkyNDUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15192452?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverFendt","html_url":"https://github.com/OliverFendt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverFendt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverFendt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverFendt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverFendt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverFendt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverFendt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverFendt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverFendt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OliverFendt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-08-23T18:24:52Z","updated_at":"2022-08-23T18:24:52Z","body":"@jlovejoy to be honest I do not understand you comment about the copyright statements.\r\n\r\nIf you look for example at the software package bash 5.1.16 there is: \r\n\r\n> Copyright (C) 1994-2014 Free Software Foundation, Inc.\r\n\r\n> This Makefile.in is free software; the Free Software Foundation\r\n   gives unlimited permission to copy and/or distribute it,\r\n   with or without modifications, as long as this notice is preserved.\r\n\r\n> This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful,\r\nbut WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY, to the extent permitted by law; without\r\neven the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A\r\nPARTICULAR PURPOSE.\r\n\r\nor if you look at grep 3.6 there is:\r\n\r\n> Copyright (C) 1994-2020 Free Software Foundation, Inc.\r\n\r\n> This Makefile.in is free software; the Free Software Foundation\r\ngives unlimited permission to copy and/or distribute it,\r\nwith or without modifications, as long as this notice is preserved.\r\n\r\n>  This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful,\r\n but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY, to the extent permitted by law; without\r\n even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A\r\n PARTICULAR PURPOSE.\r\n\r\nAnd there are probably another thousand different copyright statements followed by the same text and what I learned one has to provide the exact copyright statement which is in the file and not an arbitrary one and not an arbitrary one and the exact one.\r\n\r\nCan you please explain to me why you want to keep the copyright statement as it was provided in the request?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1224549661/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1226137886","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1556#issuecomment-1226137886","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1556","id":1226137886,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85JFWEe","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlov