/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-10-01T15:17:20Z","updated_at":"2022-10-01T15:17:20Z","body":"There are variants of this license that use \"file\" instead of \"Makefile.in\". For example:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/ianlancetaylor/libbacktrace/blob/master/aclocal.m4#L5\r\n\r\n```\r\n# generated automatically by aclocal 1.15.1 -*- Autoconf -*-\r\n\r\n# Copyright (C) 1996-2017 Free Software Foundation, Inc.\r\n\r\n# This file is free software; the Free Software Foundation\r\n# gives unlimited permission to copy and/or distribute it,\r\n# with or without modifications, as long as this notice is preserved.\r\n\r\n# This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful,\r\n# but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY, to the extent permitted by law; without\r\n# even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A\r\n# PARTICULAR PURPOSE.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1264395408/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]